{"unit_id":"lpoo451__dsh-op-splash#card-zh","repo":"lpoo451/dsh-op-splash","commit":"6a2c2e9cee11d9492149c7e1f00e03d8b7505566","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-op-splash 是面向 DSH Web 与桌面端的开场动画插件。它在 Web 启动页面注入全屏播放器，并在设置页提供管理面板；Host 端注册配置、动画清单、媒体和导入路由。用户可播放自己导入的视频、单张图片或按序播放的幻灯片，也能设置播放频率、随机权重、时段、音量、停留时间与转场，并立即预览。适合希望个性化 DSH 冷启动画面的用户。首次安装没有附带媒体，需要自行导入；配置与素材保存在本机 DSH 用户目录，无需 API key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:761-887","lib/client.js:1012-1024","lib/splash.js:264-334"]}
{"unit_id":"lpoo451__dsh-op-splash#card-en","repo":"lpoo451/dsh-op-splash","commit":"6a2c2e9cee11d9492149c7e1f00e03d8b7505566","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-op-splash adds a full-screen startup animation and settings panel to DSH. Import videos, images, or slideshows; configure schedules, random selection, volume, and transitions. No media is bundled. Imported files stay in the local DSH home directory, and no API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:761-887","lib/client.js:1012-1024","lib/splash.js:264-334"]}
