{"unit_id":"lpoo451__dsh-op-splash#feature-1","repo":"lpoo451/dsh-op-splash","commit":"6a2c2e9cee11d9492149c7e1f00e03d8b7505566","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-op-splash 的功能「冷启动播放」：启动时读取配置并选择动画，在页面注入全屏播放器；视频播完或图片停留结束后自动收起，也可手动跳过。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:867-905","lib/splash.js:264-334"]}
